---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Cookies Policy | CoverData" lang="en">
  <main class="container legal">
    <h1>Cookies Policy</h1>

    <p>
      This website only uses technical cookies strictly necessary for its operation,
      in accordance with the GDPR and the ePrivacy framework.
    </p>

    <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
    <p>
      Cookies are small text files downloaded to the user’s device to store and
      retrieve information about browsing activity.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Types of cookies</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Technical cookies</li>
      <li>Analytics cookies</li>
      <li>Personalisation cookies</li>
      <li>Advertising cookies</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Cookies used on this website</h2>
    <p>
      At present, only technical cookies strictly necessary for the operation of
      the website are used.
    </p>

    <h2>4. How to disable cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Users may allow, block or delete cookies through their browser settings.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      CoverData – <a href="mailto:info@cover-data.com">info@cover-data.com</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal h1 { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .legal h2 { margin-top: 22px; font-size: 20px; }
  .legal p, .legal li { line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; color: #334155; }
  .legal ul { margin-left: 18px; }
</style>

